Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:25.88,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa! This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:30.37,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Let's see. Ah, {\i1}Yun Yun the \NServant and Pudding the Witch{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:33.96,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You really do love this book, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:35.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.73,0:00:39.70,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I dunno why, but when \Nyou read me this book,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:42.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I can sleep real good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:47.20,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:51.24,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,All right, Papa will read it for \Nyou, so make sure you sleep soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:52.65,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:55.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.13,0:00:58.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why are you shirking your \Nduties and putting Lady Doux to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:00.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's still noon! Noon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.23,0:01:03.01,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Don't be such a spoilsport.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.01,0:01:05.58,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,There's no harm in coming to see \NDoux during her nap time, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:09.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There is! You still have \Na mountain of work to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:13.30,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:21.01,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.54,0:01:27.69,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.93,0:01:31.19,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:34.31,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Oh, I've missed you so, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.31,0:01:37.60,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Just look how big you've gotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:39.46,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:41.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-I'm Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.15,0:01:42.83,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:47.83,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah! So you've returned from \Nyour world conquest, Dahaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:51.13,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:57.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-This is the great Azi Dahaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:02.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The dragon of calamity who can bring about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:06.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,catastrophes powerful enough to\N destroy gods that is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:07.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,conquering the world by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:11.73,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And she's Lady Doux's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:13.11,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:53.50,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S WIFE LOVES\NHER DAUGHTER TOO MUCH!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:53.50,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Wife Loves \NHer Daughter Too Much!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:55.26,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Dahaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.26,0:03:57.75,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,How goes world domination?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:01.19,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Well, it didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:04.01,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Even though we were apart, my heart \Nas a mother grew even fonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:09.06,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,And I even ended up feeling \Nlove for a human child.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:11.43,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I had no time for conquering anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:13.98,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Yes! I know exactly how that feels!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:16.95,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Okay, so they're both doting parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:19.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:26.19,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Doux! There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:31.09,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I'm home! Come here! It's your mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:34.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:38.25,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,D-D-D-Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:43.22,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Why are you acting \Nlike we've never met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:45.97,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah, I feared this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:49.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:53.16,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux doesn't remember Dahaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:54.83,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It was inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:59.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Dahaka left to conquer the world before \NDoux was old enough to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:03.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:06.36,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Th-This is bad! That's \NDahaka's power at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:12.39,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Depending on Dahaka's mood, she can bring \Nabout all kinds of great disasters!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:13.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:16.46,Default,GARDEN SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Why is there suddenly a storm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:18.96,Default,SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:24.19,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-It's all right, Lady Dahaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:26.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm sure Lady Doux will \Nremember you very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:28.89,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.58,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:37.02,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Why don't you play with \NDoux like you used to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.02,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That might help her remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:43.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-That's a brilliant idea! \NNow, let's go, Lady Dahaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:50.64,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:53.91,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,She's sure to remember \Nme if we play together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.57,0:05:56.54,Default,JAHI/AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That was close...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:04.17,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But it appears that Doux is unsure \Nhow to interact with her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:08.55,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I hope she is able to remember \Nsomething as they're playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:10.68,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,This takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:14.12,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,We used to walk on the beach like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:16.60,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Do you remember, Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:17.94,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:21.06,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:24.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Oh, dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:29.03,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Dahaka! Perhaps she'll remember \Nif you two have a little race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:31.18,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,O-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:34.16,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I guess Doux is able \Nto walk by herself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:39.40,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,All right! Let's race to those rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:48.44,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I had forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:50.80,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.26,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,has absolutely no idea how to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.81,0:07:02.56,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I made a lot, so eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:09.57,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,You used to love these sweets,\N so I made them for you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:11.15,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:15.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:17.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,they're really yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:21.21,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:31.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,She said that she would like \Nto be alone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:32.97,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:38.47,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm sure that it was quite a shock \Nthat Doux didn't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:42.60,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Or rather, perhaps it's \Nregret rather than shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:45.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:58.37,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Before, Dahaka was a single \Ndragon bent on world domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:08:03.01,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But she had an evil side that \Nwanted to take over the world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:08.83,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,and a gentle side that brought \Nblessings and healing to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.77,0:08:14.64,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,And since I needed the \Npowers of her evil side,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:18.39,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I used a bracelet called the \NHeavenly Ring of Evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:25.35,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,and split her into two beings, \None evil and one good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:29.02,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,And they are... Doux and Dahaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:30.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:32.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Y-You never told me that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:34.45,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:39.35,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But that means neither of \Nus are technically her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:40.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:44.29,flashback,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I thank you, Ahriman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:50.76,flashback,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Now I can concentrate on taking over \Nthe world without any distractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:52.68,flashback,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:56.63,flashback,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I have no need for a good heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:09.05,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:12.23,flashback,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.23,0:09:13.02,flashback,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:21.22,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It was Doux's first words \Nthat made us family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:26.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-I had no idea that Lady \NDoux had such a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:32.00,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,And so, I decided to raise \NDoux into a proper demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.21,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But Dahaka believed that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:39.51,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,her love for Doux would get in the way \Nof her ambition for world domination,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:42.58,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,so she left on a journey \Nalone to take over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:47.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm certain that she \Nregrets that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:56.36,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,By the way, where is Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:20.87,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:22.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:30.55,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I was just having \Nsome trouble sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:33.19,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then Doux will read this for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:34.02,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:37.46,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I brought a picture book!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:40.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,If I read this, you'll calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.34,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:48.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,"Once upon a time, there \Nwas a servamp named Yun Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:53.44,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,and a m-musician? Named Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pudding always"... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.03,0:11:00.05,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Let me see it. I'll read it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:01.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.55,0:11:03.13,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:06.95,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,"Once upon a time, there \Nwas a servant named Yun Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:09.35,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,and a magician named Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:15.50,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Pudding always did bad things, \Nand Yun Yun was always crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:21.70,flashback,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Despite how they were, they didn't \Nactually dislike each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:23.25,flashback,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Then one day..."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.49,0:11:30.08,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,This book...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:34.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So when Papa reads me this picture book,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:40.31,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,even after I fall asleep, someone \Nreads it in my dreams, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:44.22,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I couldn't remember who that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:46.22,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,but now I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:51.48,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Yes... Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:57.74,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Okay, how about I read the \Nrest of the book for you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:11:59.23,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:01.87,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Okay, go change into your pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:03.40,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:12:02.26,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"LET'S READ THE PICTURE BOOK"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: NAOKI YANAGISAWA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:09.06,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,There's someone just \Nbeyond my fluffy dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:13.69,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,I wonder who it is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:18.40,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,They have a really, really kind voice
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:23.32,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,As they speak to me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:32.75,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Only my fuzzy memories came to me before
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:42.21,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,But now, I think I remember
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.05,0:12:47.22,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Mama, Mama
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:52.10,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,That word fills me with joy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:56.69,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Mama, Mama
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:13:01.36,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,I want to call to her even more
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:08.12,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,"And so, Pudding the Witch \Ndisappeared into the night sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.24,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,The end."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:10.98,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.38,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.69,0:13:18.51,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I'm home now, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:25.45,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE FACE REVEAL CEREMONY IS TOO SOON!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:25.45,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Face Reveal Ceremony Is Too Soon!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:28.56,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The Face Reveal Ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:31.75,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,A ceremony carried out by \Ndemons since time immemorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:35.80,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,It is a tradition where the demon \Nking's heir reveals their face
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:40.21,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,to all in the demon castle \Nwhen they are still young.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.21,0:13:44.71,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Doux was about to undergo this ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:46.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:49.30,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Make sure you come back for lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:50.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:56.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Dahaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:14:00.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,H-Have you seen Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.41,0:14:02.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I've been looking everywhere for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:05.74,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Doux just left for a walk just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:08.76,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A walk? But she has no time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:10.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The Face Reveal Ceremony is soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:15.40,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I need Lady Doux to properly act \Nlike the demon king's daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:18.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and to memorize her lines immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.74,0:14:20.57,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Dahaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:23.51,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm so worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:26.41,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Will Doux actually be able to \Nstand in front of a huge crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:28.11,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,and properly say her lines?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:31.68,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should just do this \Nin front of the ones we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:33.36,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.36,0:14:36.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,More importantly, Lady Doux \Nneeds to do her dress rehearsal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:41.48,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "More importantly"?! \NWhat if this traumatizes her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:45.31,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There you go babying her again!\NYour Majesty, this is all because...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.31,0:14:48.05,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Sometimes, you're far \Ntoo strict with Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:51.79,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Calm down, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:55.04,Default,JAHI/AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:56.82,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.82,0:15:01.29,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,If you two, who are the closest to her, \Ndon't believe in her, then who will?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:03.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:06.92,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,If you're that worried, then \Ngo find Doux right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:09.76,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,You'll know immediately that \Nthere's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:11.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Find Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:17.31,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Granny! I got lots of big cormbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:20.65,Default,GRANNY,0,0,0,,My, those are fine corn cobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:23.80,Default,GRANNY,0,0,0,,Then why don't we let you take those?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.80,0:15:25.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:28.85,Default,GRANNY,0,0,0,,Well, you're always helping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:30.86,Default,GRANNY,0,0,0,,Let me at least do this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:32.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:36.62,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:42.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We came here as Lady Dahaka insisted,\Nand Lady Doux is already helping a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:47.95,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I had no idea Doux came to \Na village so far away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.95,0:15:50.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why are you impressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.62,0:15:53.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I cannot agree with Lady Dahaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:56.76,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There are far too many things \Nto do before the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.76,0:15:59.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There's no time for this! Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:01.01,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.01,0:16:05.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Let's watch for a little while \Nlonger before we decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:10.86,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Which one has the present?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:12.85,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.85,0:16:13.61,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,The right one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.61,0:16:16.71,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Come on, Mayu! Doux gets to go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:19.83,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Shut up! I'm gonna beat Doux this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:21.00,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.43,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux picks this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:24.50,Default,MERRY,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.85,0:16:26.59,Default,MERRY,0,0,0,,Then Doux is our winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:27.13,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:30.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow! Chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:32.62,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Hey! You cheated just now, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.62,0:16:35.39,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Santa only rewards the good kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:39.22,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Damn it! You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.22,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.77,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Wh-Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:49.31,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,You don't seem too disappointed. \NYou must be in the spring of your youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:49.95,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:55.06,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,Of course. He skipped out on his \Nangel duties to come see Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.06,0:16:59.15,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up! You two are in the same boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:01.16,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,We're on break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:03.58,Default,MERRYNA,0,0,0,,It's not Santa season right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:05.29,Default,TONTT,0,0,0,,Don't lump us in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:08.29,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Shut up, shut up, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:10.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That halo... He couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:12.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Also, did she just say "Santa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:10.17,top,MAYU,0,0,0,,Stupid! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:16.43,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Wh-Who does that greenhorn think he is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.43,0:17:19.97,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,How dare he share some \Nchocolate with Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:23.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please calm down, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.49,0:17:29.48,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Hey! There's barely any \Ningredients in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:32.54,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,There's not enough milk or seafood at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.54,0:17:34.99,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,When are we supposed to get more?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:36.90,Default,COOK DEMON,0,0,0,,W-Well, Chef...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.49,Default,COOK DEMON,0,0,0,,We're having some trouble \Nwith our vendor...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:42.10,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,What?! You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:45.45,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,I'm putting my life on the line cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:50.12,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Ugh, what am I supposed to do? \NThis isn't going to do at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.30,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:52.13,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.54,0:17:53.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:56.55,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Doux? This is for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.55,0:18:01.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! I heard you this morning \Nsaying there wasn't any food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:08.77,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,The cormbs from Granny's fields \Nare super sweet and yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.77,0:18:10.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They'll go with anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:12.30,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:14.86,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:19.29,Default,COOK DEMON,0,0,0,,B-But, Chef! None of your \Nrecipes today need corn...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:21.24,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Forget about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:25.25,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Thanks to Doux, I thought \Nup an even better dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:29.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I guess Lady Doux helped Thaiti out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.13,0:18:32.19,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,She's grown into such a kind child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:36.26,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone! You don't \Nneed to rush so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.69,0:18:39.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:42.94,Default,GARDEN SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,What is this? It's super good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:45.93,Default,HUMAN FEMALE SLAVE,0,0,0,,I've never eaten something so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:50.19,Default,GRAMPS SLAVE C,0,0,0,,B-But why do we slaves get some, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:54.57,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,There's enough for everyone! Here, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:58.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:00.70,Default,ASSIM,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:05.07,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Look, Doux is serving them food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.07,0:19:06.75,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,U-Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:10.13,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I want to eat food that \NDoux serves me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:13.83,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Er, stop being jealous and \Nstop her, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:15.80,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:20.94,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I came in time for the Face \NReveal Ceremony and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:26.26,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Are you the dunce serving \Nthese lesser humans food?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:28.17,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:30.83,Default,THAITI,0,0,0,,Doux said she wanted to eat with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:29.17,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:31.73,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:37.01,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,It's your failure that you let \Nher words sway your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:39.17,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Stop her at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.54,0:19:41.24,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:46.43,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I will turn everyone involved \Ninto slabs of meat right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.99,0:19:50.27,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,S-So this is the aura of\Nthe previous demon king Zareth,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:52.75,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,said to make even demons tremble...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:56.72,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Brilliant! I'm sure that Lord Zareth \Nwill be able to stop Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:57.79,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:01.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This is for you, Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:07.64,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux made yours special and made \Nyour veggies into stars, Pawpaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:10.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Make sure you eat all the stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:12.64,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.64,0:20:15.76,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,You made this just for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.76,0:20:17.52,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:20.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's hopeless. I need to \Nhurry and do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:25.16,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Oh my. It's always so lively around Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:28.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,L-Lady Dahaka. This is no laughing matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.93,0:20:31.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is all happening because Lady \NDoux is spreading her kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:34.28,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Oh. But what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.28,0:20:38.54,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,After seeing this, I'm fairly certain \Nshe'll be just fine tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.78,0:20:39.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:44.84,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see! So this is why you \Nwanted us to go find Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:47.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.55,0:20:51.61,Default,CHILD D,0,0,0,,Doux, it was really yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.61,0:20:53.86,Default,OTHERS,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:56.62,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Big Bro, this is super tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:20:59.69,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,Isn't it great that we \Ncame to this castle, Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:01.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,There's plenty more!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.93,0:21:03.57,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:06.20,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I've made a new magic potion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:07.69,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:11.75,Default,URUN/GAUCHE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:17.22,Default,MUS,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry! \NI'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:18.53,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:21.10,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,I just learned this recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:26.14,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,but basically everyone who lives in \Nthe demon castle are Doux's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,H-Her friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.09,0:21:30.94,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Demons and humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:33.37,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Magical beasts and witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:37.34,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Possibly even others...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.15,0:21:44.34,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Everyone who's encountered Doux at \Nleast once mysteriously gather to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.15,0:21:47.66,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,That's why there's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.66,0:21:50.06,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,Doux isn't scared of anything
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:55.08,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,so there's no need to force her to act \Na certain way or say certain things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:22:01.54,Default,DAHAKA,0,0,0,,As long as she's herself,\N she will look dignified to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:03.92,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:09.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I-Is this really okay?
